 "nl": [
  "Allow cameras to connect to dns-servers using SNMP (UDP 161) and HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443).",
  "guest-wifi is isolated: it may only reach hr on DNS over UDP 53; backup on syslog (UDP 514), and nothing else.",
  "Make HTTP (TCP 80) and NTP (UDP 123) on backup reachable from all internal zones.",
  "Hosts in scada may reach library over NTP (UDP 123) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Deny all traffic from printers to dev-lab (this overrides any public service).",
  "cameras must accept SMB (TCP 445) from guest-wifi.",
  "printers must accept SNMP (UDP 161) and PostgreSQL (TCP 5432) from backup.",
  "backup offers NTP (UDP 123) and HTTP (TCP 80) to every zone."
 ],
